{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/shuffled()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:STsE8shuffledSay7ElementQzGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"shuffled","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","title":"shuffled()","modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/shuffled()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Inherited from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sequence.shuffled()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"shuffled"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/shuffled()":{"title":"shuffled()","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/shuffled()","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/shuffled()","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"shuffled"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"title":"Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","abstract":[],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"kind":"symbol","title":"MaximalCliques","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MaximalCliques"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol"}}}